rgetRectangle":{"y":147.97743225097656,"x":23.12115478515625,"width":50,"height":48.84259033203125}},{"text":"pasted-image.pdf","targetRectangle":{"y":16.941118240356445,"x":13.121153831481934,"width":70,"height":68.703704833984375}},{"text":"1. If God exists, then God is omnipotent.","targetRectangle":{"y":136.69557189941406,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":393.6767578125,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"2. If something is omnipotent, it can do anything.","targetRectangle":{"y":186.29557263851166,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":406.79931640625,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"3. If God exists, then God can do anything. (1,2)","targetRectangle":{"y":235.89557337760925,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":406.79931640625,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"4. If God exists, then God is wholly good.","targetRectangle":{"y":285.49557411670685,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":393.6767578125,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"5. If something is wholly good, it always eliminates as much evil as it can.","targetRectangle":{"y":335.09557485580444,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":419.921875,"height":80.600000739097595}},{"text":"6. If God exists, then God eliminates as much evil as God can. (4,5)","targetRectangle":{"y":409.49557596445084,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":387.30908203125,"height":80.600000739097595}},{"text":"7. If God exists, then God eliminates all evil. (3,6)","targetRectangle":{"y":483.89557707309723,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":374.1865234375,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"8. If God exists, then there is no evil. (7)","targetRectangle":{"y":533.49557781219482,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":419.921875,"height":55.800000369548798}},{"text":"9. Some evil exists.","targetRectangle":{"y":583.09557855129242,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":262.451171875,"height":31}},{"text":"————————————————","targetRectangle":{"y":607.89557892084122,"x":117.49985504150391,"width":209.9609375,"height":31}},{"text":"C. God does not exist. (8,9)","targetRectangle":{